{#- Six-item launch checklist. Every game fact is in docs/research/CONFIRMED_FACTS.md. -#}
{%- set RS = "https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/4QfG4FmZCf5W1gS8jy4UVT/grand-theft-auto-vi-platform-editions-and-versions" %}
<ol class="checklist" data-checklist="launch-short">
  <li><label><input type="checkbox" data-id="buy"> <span><strong>Pre-order or buy before November 20</strong> to get the Vintage Vice City Pack. {% badge "confirmed" %} <a href="{{ RS }}" rel="noopener">Rockstar Support</a></span></label></li>
  <li><label><input type="checkbox" data-id="preload"> <span><strong>Pre-load opens November 12</strong> at local midnight. {% badge "confirmed" %} <a href="{{ RS }}" rel="noopener">Rockstar Support</a></span></label></li>
  <li><label><input type="checkbox" data-id="box"> <span><strong>Boxed copies are a download code,</strong> not a disc, so check your connection. {% badge "confirmed" %} <a href="{{ RS }}" rel="noopener">Rockstar Support</a></span></label></li>
  <li><label><input type="checkbox" data-id="space"> <span><strong>Free up storage.</strong> The file size isn't announced. {% badge "unverified" %}</span></label></li>
  <li><label><input type="checkbox" data-id="alert"> <span><strong>Turn on the unlock alert</strong> for your region. <a href="#signup">Sign up</a></span></label></li>
  <li><label><input type="checkbox" data-id="map"> <span><strong>Bookmark the map.</strong> It opens on launch day. <a href="/map/">GTA 6 map</a></span></label></li>
</ol>
<p class="note">Saved on this device. The full list with more detail: <a href="/launch-checklist/">GTA 6 launch checklist</a>.</p>
